88kjJUN4TtfiHbCsq9aIIVt04hFlRDf66p3e-rVy-A&oe=6AA7F2CA"}, {"file_name": "\u30b7\u30fc\u30b1\u30f3\u30b9 07.00_07_18_09.\u9759\u6b62\u753b016.png", "id": "1055880709752627", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618217_1055880713085960_1626693538717808173_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y4pnFL-iBbcQ7kNvwEtT1Ra&_nc_oc=AdommcW0VPrdFI3K8-DWG_ndW_2shLnRl94Cti-obJwEe51HuMoqzEhT2kH0ckrUCVs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIvtcoHdJrm9JCPHVyamgyCTjbFen2S17hE6Xq89z5Hdw&oe=6AA7FE66"}, {"file_name": "\u30b7\u30fc\u30b1\u30f3\u30b9 07.00_00_13_00.\u9759\u6b62\u753b020.png", "id": "1874068993435096", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499349026_1874068996768429_7489400502973245992_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sGpUN8R8GHcQ7kNvwGX1Jv7&_nc_oc=AdrQbde3PjUK31mhHPey4OklXtIqakbRr2JiskS4PT1PCFHfgHZrAXkG4Wagt41x6Zw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKOPNN6eu0bZyEM_c7iqXZ0chUq4PlCaV77IBtHDnMpww&oe=6AA7E8FA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape.png", "id": "2825875957604900", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617698_2825875960938233_5209709702361359124_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7XXBPx7-ccMQ7kNvwFabfdP&_nc_oc=AdpgRZyG18uZ_BGRAdaD7zghKlh4aSN75zmsLn5iKehhgFTKAK-EdJzI7c5nvFmlNPo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKDueLGRxKsyaT4GDvdJyc9HkGukTFSgtO9DUnrPS-0dg&oe=6AA8069D"}, "display_name": "Bad Bunny Bonanza", "keywords": ["Bazooka", "shooting", "physics"], "long_description": "New Stage Update!\nClimb along walls, get launched by gigantic fans, and swoosh down massive slides! Dive into the action-packed new stage now!\n\n\ud83d\ude80Blast Your Way to Chaos!\ud83d\ude80\n Bad Bunny Bonanza is an explosive VR action game where you have cannons strapped to your arms and use physics-based mayhem to reach the goal!\n\n\ud